msgstr "%s：請輸入國家，或勾選「請詢問員工」。"

#: includes/origin.php:260 includes/qr.php:129 includes/qr.php:322
#: includes/admin.php:128 includes/admin.php:243 includes/admin.php:268
#: includes/admin.php:280 includes/admin.php:331
msgid "You are not allowed to change the menu."
msgstr "您沒有權限修改菜單。"

#: includes/origin.php:266
msgid "Meat and fish origin"
msgstr "肉類及海鮮產地"

#: includes/origin.php:266 includes/qr.php:164
msgid "Saved."
msgstr "已儲存。"

#: includes/origin.php:275 includes/origin.php:322
msgid "Product"
msgstr "產品"

#: includes/origin.php:276
msgid "Choose …"
msgstr "請選擇…"

#: includes/origin.php:280
msgid "Other (type the name) …"
msgstr "其他（輸入名稱）…"

#. translators: %s: language, DE, EN or 中文.
#: includes/origin.php:284
#, php-format
msgid "Name %s"
msgstr "名稱 %s"

#: includes/origin.php:288 includes/origin.php:322
msgid "Countries"
msgstr "國家"

#: includes/origin.php:289
msgid "Ask our staff"
msgstr "請詢問員工"

#: includes/origin.php:302
msgid "Meat and fish origin (Herkunft)"
msgstr "肉類及海鮮產地（Herkunft）"

#. translators: 1: shortcode [menudash_origin], 2: lang="de", 3: title="no", 4: allergy="yes".
#: includes/origin.php:307
#, php-format
msgid ""
"In Switzerland, restaurants must say in writing where their meat comes from. "
"Choose each product and type its countries in German or English (\"Schweiz, "
"Deutschland\"); MenuDash writes them in all three menu languages. Countries "
"it doesn't know stay as you typed them. The list shows under the menu, and "
"on any page with %1$s (%2$s for German only, %3$s without the heading, %4$s "
"with the allergy note under it)."
msgstr ""
"在瑞士，餐廳必須以書面列明肉類的來源地。請選擇每項產品，並以德文或英文輸入其"
"國家（例如「Schweiz, Deutschland」）；MenuDash 會以菜單的三種語言顯示。無法辨"
"識的國家會按您輸入的內容顯示。清單會顯示在菜單下方，也可在任何頁面使用 %1$s"
"（%2$s 只顯示德文，%3$s 不顯示標題，%4$s 在下方加上過敏原說明）。"

#: includes/origin.php:318 includes/qr.php:299
