msgstr "無法儲存 %1$s：%2$s"

#: includes/svg-clean.php:38
msgid "This server cannot read SVG files; upload a PNG instead."
msgstr "此伺服器無法讀取 SVG 檔案；請改為上傳 PNG。"

#: includes/svg-clean.php:41
msgid "The SVG is over 200 KB; an icon is usually a few KB."
msgstr "SVG 超過 200 KB，而圖示通常只有幾 KB。"

#: includes/svg-clean.php:44 includes/svg-clean.php:54
msgid "The SVG declares a DOCTYPE or entities, which icons never need."
msgstr "SVG 宣告了 DOCTYPE 或實體，而圖示從不需要這些。"

#: includes/svg-clean.php:58
msgid "This is not an SVG file."
msgstr "這不是 SVG 檔案。"

#: includes/svg-clean.php:66
msgid "The SVG has no size (no viewBox, width or height)."
msgstr "SVG 沒有尺寸（沒有 viewBox、width 或 height）。"

#: includes/svg-clean.php:73
msgid "Nothing drawable was found in the SVG."
msgstr "SVG 中找不到可繪製的內容。"

#: includes/qr.php:105 includes/qr.php:164
msgid "QR code"
msgstr "QR 碼"

#. translators: %s: the web address in the QR code.
#: includes/qr.php:121
#, php-format
msgid "QR code: %s"
msgstr "QR 碼：%s"

#: includes/qr.php:140
msgid "The link is not a web address; the menu page is used."
msgstr "連結不是有效的網址，因此改用菜單頁面。"

#: includes/qr.php:156
msgid "Choose at least one language; all are used."
msgstr "請至少選擇一種語言；現已使用全部語言。"

#: includes/qr.php:190
msgid "Wi-Fi QR code"
msgstr "Wi-Fi QR 碼"

#: includes/qr.php:238
msgid "QR code and table cards"
msgstr "QR 碼與桌卡"

#: includes/qr.php:239
msgid ""
"A QR code that opens your menu on the guest's phone. Print it as table cards "
"(four A6 cards on an A4 sheet, cut along the grey lines), or download it for "
"a flyer, a sticker or the window."
msgstr ""
"一個可在客人手機上開啟菜單的 QR 碼。可列印成桌卡（一張 A4 紙印四張 A6 卡，沿"
"灰線裁剪），或下載用於傳單、貼紙或櫥窗。"

#: includes/qr.php:245
msgid "Link"
msgstr "連結"

#: includes/qr.php:247
msgid ""
"Empty: your menu page. Printed cards keep working as long as this address "
"does, so change it only when you have to."
msgstr ""
"留空：使用菜單頁面。只要此網址有效，已列印的卡片就能使用，因此非必要請勿更"
"改。"

#: includes/qr.php:249
msgid "Own heading"
msgstr "自訂標題"

#. translators: %s: the card's built-in heading in the three menu languages.
#: includes/qr.php:252
#, php-format
msgid "Optional. Empty: \"%s\", in the languages ticked below."
msgstr "選填。留空則以下方勾選的語言顯示「%s」。"

#: includes/qr.php:254
msgid "Wi-Fi name"
msgstr "Wi-Fi 名稱"

#: includes/qr.php:257
msgid "Wi-Fi password"
msgstr "Wi-Fi 密碼"

#: includes/qr.php:259
msgid ""
"Both optional: without a Wi-Fi name the card shows no Wi-Fi part. With one, "
"the card also gets a small Wi-Fi code: guests scan it with the phone camera "
"and join without typing (no password: an open network). Only the printed "
"card shows them, never the website."
msgstr ""
"兩者皆為選填：沒有 Wi-Fi 名稱時，卡片不會顯示 Wi-Fi 部分。填寫後，卡片會多一"
"個小的 Wi-Fi 碼：客人用手機相機掃描即可連線，無需輸入（沒有密碼即為開放網"
"路）。這些資料只會印在卡片上，不會出現在網站。"

#: includes/qr.php:261
msgid "Tip"
msgstr "提示"

#: includes/qr.php:262
msgid ""
"Show the tip \"Choose your language and filter by vegetarian, vegan, gluten-"
"free or spicy.\""
msgstr "顯示提示「可選擇語言，並按素食、純素、無麩質或辣度篩選。」"

#: includes/qr.php:263
msgid "Under the web address, in the languages ticked below."
msgstr "顯示在網址下方，使用下方勾選的語言。"

#: includes/qr.php:265
msgid "Own message"
msgstr "自訂訊息"

#: includes/qr.php:266
msgid "e.g. Free Wi-Fi for our guests"
msgstr "例如：為客人提供免費 Wi-Fi"

#: includes/qr.php:267
msgid "Optional, under the tip: up to 4 short lines, in any language."
msgstr "選填，顯示在提示下方：最多 4 行短句，任何語言皆可。"

#: includes/qr.php:269
msgid "Languages on the card"
msgstr "卡片上的語言"

#: includes/qr.php:273
msgid ""
"The heading, the tip and the Wi-Fi words are printed in each ticked "
"language, in the menu's order. A full card makes its text a little smaller "
"by itself."
msgstr ""
"標題、提示和 Wi-Fi 字樣會以每種勾選的語言列印，順序與菜單相同。卡片內容較多"
"時，文字會自動稍微縮小。"

#: includes/qr.php:275
msgid "Print size"
msgstr "列印尺寸"

#: includes/qr.php:276
msgid "4 table cards (A6) on one A4 sheet"
msgstr "一張 A4 紙印 4 張桌卡（A6）"

