msgid "A part of the file is too large to be a menu."
msgstr "檔案中有部分內容太大，不像是菜單。"

#: includes/xlsx.php:71
msgid ""
"The file contains XML declarations a spreadsheet does not need; it was not "
"read."
msgstr "檔案包含試算表不需要的 XML 宣告，因此沒有讀取。"

#: includes/xlsx.php:128
msgid ""
"This server cannot read Excel files (PHP's zip extension is missing). Export "
"the sheet as CSV instead, or ask the host to enable \"zip\"."
msgstr ""
"此伺服器無法讀取 Excel 檔案（缺少 PHP 的 zip 擴充功能）。請改為將工作表匯出"
"為 CSV，或請主機商啟用「zip」。"

#: includes/xlsx.php:136
msgid ""
"This is not an Excel file (.xlsx). From Numbers: File → Export To → Excel."
msgstr "這不是 Excel 檔案（.xlsx）。在 Numbers 中：檔案 → 輸出為 → Excel。"

#: includes/xlsx.php:140
msgid "The Excel file could not be opened."
msgstr "無法開啟 Excel 檔案。"

#: includes/xlsx.php:144
msgid "The file has too many parts to be a menu."
msgstr "檔案包含太多部分，不像是菜單。"

#: includes/xlsx.php:148
msgid ""
"The file contains macros (.xlsm). Save it as a normal Excel workbook (.xlsx) "
"or export CSV."
msgstr ""
"檔案包含巨集（.xlsm）。請另存為一般 Excel 活頁簿（.xlsx），或匯出 CSV。"

#: includes/xlsx.php:157
msgid "This does not look like an Excel workbook (.xlsx)."
msgstr "這看起來不是 Excel 活頁簿（.xlsx）。"

#: includes/xlsx.php:252
msgid "The workbook has no sheets with cells in them."
msgstr "活頁簿中沒有含內容的工作表。"

