msgid "%1$s is too large (%2$d × %3$d px); save it at most 6000 px wide."
msgstr "%1$s 太大（%2$d × %3$d px）；請以最多 6000 px 的寬度儲存。"

msgid ""
"A restaurant menu for your website, kept in a spreadsheet: upload the "
"menu as CSV and the dish photos under MenuDash, then put [menudash] on a "
"page. Guests read it in German, English and Chinese, all at once or one "
"at a time, and filter by diet. Background and highlight colours and the "
"diet icons are chosen on the MenuDash page, and a QR code to the menu "
"prints as table cards. Add-ons: MenuDash Restaurant (details, opening "
"hours, holidays, \"open now\"), MenuDash Specials (today's specials) and "
"MenuDash Gift Cards (gift card orders)."
msgstr ""
"為您的網站提供餐廳菜單，內容保存在試算表中：在 MenuDash 上傳 CSV 菜單和菜"
"式照片，然後在頁面中加入 [menudash]。客人可用德文、英文和中文閱讀，可同時"
"顯示或逐一切換，並按飲食需要篩選。背景色、強調色和飲食標示圖示可在 "
"MenuDash 頁面中選擇，連到菜單的 QR 碼可列印成桌卡。附加元件：MenuDash "
"Restaurant（餐廳資料、營業時間、休假、「營業中」）、MenuDash Specials（今"
"日推薦）和 MenuDash Gift Cards（禮券訂單）。"
